              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Walking pad</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$249.99 (SpaceWalk 3S)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">UREVO pads from $139.99 to $399.99</td></tr>
